        {
          "field": "adaptation",
          "verdict": "issue",
          "quote": "**Wild** covers nature (*wild animals*, *wild flowers*), behavior (*a wild party*), and strong feeling (*go wild*); many languages use different words for these, so translate each sense on its own.",
          "severity": "minor",
          "family": "adaptation",
          "reason": "Violates the notes discipline rule: a generic 'translate each sense separately' note is an issue and should be null."
